The Exynos 7885 DISPAUD clocks (CMU_DISPAUD at 0x14800000, with the audio PLL,
a PLL1431X) and CMU_TOP DISPAUD_CPU branch, which ABOX and its System MMU run
on. From the Galaxy Tab A 10.1 2019 port by Mollomm1
(github.com/Mollomm1/linux-exynos7885, branch gta3xl: 2196d4997f, c6bebb14c0,
627f7e19e3, c32713eb2c, 865aa28460, 670325fe1f, bc746373d3, 543763be7f),
on top of the M20 changes patch-kernel.py makes before it; the DPU System MMU
gate is left out, and the PLL uses 7.1 determine_rate.

Registered only with exynos7885.dispaud=1 on the command line, as there.

